# Hand-encoded AArch64 A64 instructions, little-endian words, loaded at 0x1000.
# Encoding reference: Arm Architecture Reference Manual for A-profile architecture:
# https://developer.arm.com/documentation/ddi0487/latest
# 0x1000: CMP W0, #0       word 0x7100001f
# 0x1004: B.EQ 0x1010      word 0x54000060 (imm19=3 => PC + 12)
# 0x1008: ADD W0, W0, #1   word 0x11000400
# 0x100c: B 0x1014          word 0x14000002 (imm26=2 => PC + 8)
# 0x1010: SUB W0, W0, #1   word 0x51000400
# 0x1014: RET               word 0xd65f03c0
1f 00 00 71
60 00 00 54
00 04 00 11
02 00 00 14
00 04 00 51
c0 03 5f d6
